WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.290
Unit seven. My Five Senses!

2
00:00:04.243 --> 00:00:07.969
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.019 --> 00:00:11.216
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.266 --> 00:00:14.861
Today we learn about My Five Senses. Let's go!

5
00:00:15.924 --> 00:00:19.441
See. Say it with me. See!

6
00:00:22.954 --> 00:00:26.554
Hear. Say it with me. Hear!

7
00:00:30.054 --> 00:00:33.587
Smell. Say it with me. Smell!

8
00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:40.547
Taste. Say it with me. Taste!

9
00:00:44.076 --> 00:00:47.409
Touch. Say it with me. Touch!

10
00:00:50.870 --> 00:00:54.287
Eyes. Say it with me. Eyes!

11
00:00:57.772 --> 00:01:01.238
Ears. Say it with me. Ears!

12
00:01:04.746 --> 00:01:07.979
Tongue. Say it with me. Tongue!

13
00:01:11.474 --> 00:01:19.484
I have five senses. I see with my eyes and hear with my ears. I smell with my nose, taste with my tongue, and touch with my hands.

14
00:01:19.534 --> 00:01:20.774
I can do that too!

15
00:01:22.106 --> 00:01:27.175
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:27.225 --> 00:01:28.375
Smell!

17
00:01:29.157 --> 00:01:34.423
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:34.473 --> 00:01:35.623
Ears!

19
00:01:36.515 --> 00:01:43.473
Did you know? Your nose and tongue work together — food tastes different when your nose is blocked by a cold!

20
00:01:43.523 --> 00:01:45.300
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:45.978 --> 00:01:54.105
Think and answer. Which of your senses do you use when you eat?

22
00:01:54.155 --> 00:01:55.305
Great answer!

23
00:01:56.312 --> 00:02:01.188
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:01.238 --> 00:02:03.798
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

